{"step_index":1399,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T21:43:26Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough updated to reflect the refined executive quiet-luxury aesthetic.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Refined Executive Classy Styling & Features\n\n## 1. Quiet Luxury & Understated Executive Aesthetic\n- **Matte Charcoal Canvas**: Replaced loud glowing neons with a deep, calm matte obsidian slate (`#0b0e14`) and subtle atmospheric depth.\n- **Refined Natural Typography**: Pure, high-contrast headings in crisp off-white (`#ffffff` / `#f8fafc`) with natural font weights and zero text gradient masking.\n- **Clean Slate Cards & Hairline Borders**: Matte cards with refined 1px borders (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`), subtle corner radiuses (10px–12px), and calm, natural drop-shadows.\n- **Dignified Tab Navigation**: Segmented slate tab bar with crisp white active indicators on dark slate (`#1e293b`).\n- **Balanced Metric Tiles**: Clean executive KPI stat cards with muted colored top accents (Emerald, Crimson, Amber, Steel Blue) and crisp monospace figures.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Integrated Features & Verification\n- **Animated Production Line Simulator**: Live conveyor physics canvas in Tab 2 with clean station cards, smooth WIP bead progression, and pulsing constraint alerts.\n- **3D Profitability Optimization Frontier**: Continuous 3D response landscape in Tab 4 with executive slate-to-steel color terrain and active operating point tracking.\n- **100% Emoji-Free**: Professional Swiss/corporate presentation standard.\n- **Clean Configuration**: Fully wired `.env` environment support.\n","Description":"Update walkthrough artifact","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\win-10\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\f365fb6f-b130-4162-803f-d8faca0d55a2\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough artifact","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough artifact"}}]}
