{"step_index":1401,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T21:43:32Z","content":"The UI has been redesigned to ease out the aggressive futuristic glow in favor of an **understated, dignified, executive aesthetic** (inspired by Swiss/Nordic industrial design and Apple Pro tools):\n\n---\n\n### What Changed for the Classy Look\n\n1. **Matte Obsidian & Charcoal Canvas**\n   - Removed aggressive cyan gradients, background grid dots, and heavy neon blooms.\n   - Replaced with a calm, deep matte slate background (`#0b0e14`) with a soft, natural overhead radial vignette.\n\n2. **Crisp, Authoritative Typography**\n   - Headings are rendered in pure, high-contrast matte white (`#ffffff` / `#f8fafc`) with natural font weights and zero text gradient masking.\n   - Removed decorative heading line markers (`::before`) for a clean, editorial look.\n   - Labels and subtitles use soft, warm slate (`#94a3b8` / `#64748b`).\n\n3. **Matte Slate Cards & Hairline Borders**\n   - Cards now use solid matte charcoal (`#101520`) with refined 1px hairline borders (`rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08)`) and crisp 10px–12px corners.\n   - Soft, natural drop-shadows that feel tactile without visual clutter.\n\n4. **Segmented Executive Navigation Tabs**\n   - Clean slate tab bar with crisp white active tab indicators on dark slate (`#1e293b`), providing clean visual feedback.\n\n5. **Dignified Metric & Stat Tiles**\n   - Replaced heavy colored gradients with understated, thin top accent lines in classic industrial tones (Forest Emerald, Crimson, Amber, Steel Blue).\n   - Figures are presented in crisp, readable `JetBrains Mono` monospace.\n\n6. **Refined Controls & 3D Landscape**\n   - Sliders and buttons use matte slate finishes with solid steel-blue accents (`#0284c7`).\n   - The 3D profit optimization surface uses an executive slate-to-steel color terrain with soft hairline gridlines.\n\n---\n\n### Launch to View:\n```powershell\nstreamlit run app.py\n```"}
